@host = http://localhost:5030

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Start saga: create habit (happy path)
POST {{host}}/workflows/create-habit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "title": "Morning run",
  "description": "5km",
  "forceStep3Failure": false
}

### Start saga: force step-3 failure - compensation deletes habit
POST {{host}}/workflows/create-habit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "title": "Evening stretch",
  "description": null,
  "forceStep3Failure": true
}

### Get workflow status (replace id)
GET {{host}}/workflows/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
